# Portal member session contract

Guest **registration** (P6-1) and member **self-service** (P6-3) share the same public-auth session on the **portal host** (`portal.{club}.localhost` locally for M↔P cookie share; legacy `{club}.portal.{root}` still parses).

**Profile architecture (frozen):** [platform-portal-member-profile.mdoc](./platform-portal-member-profile.mdoc) — canonical BFF, SDK capabilities, migration from current split paths.

## Host

| Env | Portal member base |
| --- | ------------------ |
| Dev (canonical M↔P) | `http://portal.{club}.localhost:3003` |
| Dev (legacy) | `http://{club}.portal.localhost:3003` |
| Prod (platform) | `https://{club}.portal.{root}` |
| Prod (custom) | `https://portal.{apex}` via `tenant_domains` · `surface=portal` |

Authority: [p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc](p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc)

---

## Session (frozen)

| Item | Value |
| ---- | ----- |
| Cookie | `atour_mb_session` (`SESSION_COOKIE_NAMES.member` in `@app-tour/session-client`) · httpOnly · set by portal BFF after `verify-otp` or `register-complete` |
| Operator cookie (web only) | `atour_op_session` — **not** used on portal member routes |
| Actor | JWT `role` claim · typical guest flow creates `member` · `ACTIVE` membership on tenant |
| TTL | Same as operator session policy in `apps/api` identity layer |
| Scope | Tenant-bound — `sessionTenantMatchesHost` on `/me/*` and `/api/me/*` |

### BFF headers to API

Portal BFF routes under `/api/public-auth/*` and `/api/me/*` forward:

```text
x-tenant-id     ← resolved from Host / public tenant context
Authorization   ← session token from cookie (member routes)
```

Portal `/me` is **not** the operator admin panel (`apps/web`). Product rule: operators use `{club}.admin.{root}`; members use portal host. Middleware accepts any valid JWT role on portal host today; **do not** rely on role rejection until explicitly gated (see freeze doc).

---

## Routes (P6-3)

| Route | Auth | Purpose |
| ----- | ---- | ------- |
| `/me/registrations` | member session | List own tour registrations — **self vs other:** URL filter `?target=all\|self\|other` (presentation-only; BFF still returns both) + row badges (`forSelfBadge` / `forOtherBadge` + guest name when other). Workspace delta: [portal-member-registrations.md](../workspaces/denali/portal-member-registrations.md) · uniqueness: [registration-self-other-uniqueness.mdoc](../workspaces/denali/registration-self-other-uniqueness.mdoc) § Member trips |
| `/me/registrations/[id]` | member session | Detail + offline receipt panel (upload / waiting / paid) + **pending intake amend** (transport) + guest identity when registration is for someone else |
| `/me/profile` | member session | Edit profile fields (capability-driven · see freeze doc) |
| `GET /api/me/registrations` | member session | BFF list proxy (forwards `tourId` from bookings) |
| `GET /api/me/registrations/for-tour?tourId=` | member session | Self-registration gate for catalog register page |
| `GET /api/me/registrations/[id]/receipt` | member session | Receipt status for detail SSR / refresh |
| `POST /api/me/registrations/[id]/receipt` | member session | Upload offline receipt proof |
| `PATCH /api/me/registrations/[id]/intake` | member session | Amend allowlisted `registrationIntake` while pending/waitlisted |
| `GET/PATCH /api/me/profile` | member session | **Landed M2** — sole profile BFF |
| `POST /api/public-auth/logout` | none (idempotent) | Clear `atour_mb_session` · **Landed** 2026-07-02 |

API upstream (frozen — reuse Phase 9.5 member filter + PS-5 entitlements):

| BFF route | Upstream API | Scope |
| --------- | ------------ | ----- |
| `GET /api/me/registrations` | `GET /bookings?view=mine` | session user + tenant RLS · includes `tourId` |
| `GET /api/me/registrations/for-tour?tourId=` | `GET /denali/registrations/for-tour/:tourId` | member; `{ self: { id, status } \| null }` — Denali product semantics |
| `GET /api/me/registrations/[id]/receipt` | `GET /bookings/{registrationId}/receipts` | member-only · `{ status: none\|pending\|rejected\|paid }` |
| `POST /api/me/registrations/[id]/receipt` | `POST /bookings/{registrationId}/receipts` | member-only; **requires booking.status=`approved`** (else `FINANCE_RECEIPT_REQUIRES_APPROVED_BOOKING`); then ensures pending manual payment + receipt |
| `PATCH /api/me/registrations/[id]/intake` | `PATCH /denali/registrations/:id` | member owns row; status pending/waitlisted; transport allowlist only |

**Self / other uniqueness + amend authority:** [registration-self-other-uniqueness.mdoc](../workspaces/denali/registration-self-other-uniqueness.mdoc).

**Approve-then-pay (2026-08-06):** Offline receipt upload is gated on booking lifecycle. Portal detail stages UI from `booking.status` (from `GET /bookings?view=mine`) before showing the upload form. Authority: [registration-payment-orchestration.mdoc](../workspaces/denali/registration-payment-orchestration.mdoc). Per-tour `pricing.registrationApproval: auto` (wizard checkbox `requiresManualAdminApproval` off, phase 3.1) may land the member already `approved`. Checkbox on stays `pending` unless phase 3.2 `participants.autoApproveMinRecentTours` (1–3) matches approved self attendance on the last N published club tours before this one. Per-tour `pricing.paymentCollection: free` marks `paymentStatus=paid` after approve without a receipt (phase 4).
| `GET /api/me/entitlements` | `GET /identity/me/entitlements` | Registry effective modules for tenant workspace (bootstrap grant-all) |
| `GET /api/me/home` | Portal-composed | Registry + entitlements aggregate (bootstrap) |

**POST receipt BFF steps (2026-07-17 — bytes to MinIO):**

1. Read multipart `file` from member (image/* or PDF).
2. Forward **raw file bytes** to `POST /bookings/{registrationId}/receipts` with the file `Content-Type` and `x-receipt-file-name` (not JSON-only `fileKey`).
3. API stores the object in MinIO under `receipts/{tenantId}/{registrationId}/{sanitizedFileName}`, ensures pending manual payment, creates receipt with that `fileKey`.
4. **Legacy/smoke JSON path** still accepted: `Content-Type: application/json` + `{ fileKey }` (no object write — memory E2E).

**Operator proof preview:** `GET /finance/receipts/{id}/url` returns a **presigned MinIO** `https?://…` URL when storage is configured. Admin BFF rewrites to same-origin `/api/finance/receipts/{id}/file` for `<img>` (avoids MinIO CORS on `*.admin.localhost`).

**Do not** POST multipart to `/finance/receipts` — operator finance upload remains JSON `{ paymentId, fileKey }` only.

