## Logout

| Route | Status | Behavior |
| ----- | ------ | -------- |
| `POST /api/public-auth/logout` | **Landed** (2026-07-02) | Clears `atour_mb_session` via `clearSessionCookieOnResponse` · returns `{ ok: true }` · **no** API revoke (parity with operator `POST /api/auth/logout`) |

**Client (member nav):** `MemberLogoutButton` in `/me` layout — `POST /api/public-auth/logout` then hard navigate to **`/login`** on the portal host (member auth surface). Hooks: `data-public-auth-logout` · `data-public-auth-logout-ready="true"` after hydration · `data-public-auth-logout-target="login"`.

**Why `/login` (not `/`):** Portal `/` without a session is **guest egress** to marketing (`resolvePortalGuestEgressUrl`). Explicit logout must not depend on marketing `:3002` being up — landing on portal `/login` keeps PCMS authority on the portal host and matches “sign out → sign in again.”

**E2E:** **SMK-PTL-06** — register → `/me/registrations` → `data-public-auth-logout` (hydration-ready) → `POST /api/public-auth/logout` 200 → cookie cleared → path leaves `/me/*` (typically `/login`) → middleware `307`/`401` on member routes. Anonymous portal `/` may still egress to marketing; smoke may pin `MARKETING_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` to portal `/health` when exercising that path.

**Middleware:** `/api/public-auth/logout` is **not** behind `/api/me/*` guard — callable without valid session (idempotent clear).

Unauthenticated access to `/me/*` → redirect to `/` (portal home → marketing when no session).

---

## Register success → /me (P6-3-N-008)

After `[data-public-registration-success]` on `/catalog/{tourId}/register`, primary CTA links to `/me/registrations`.

---

## Portal home redirect (P6-3-N-009)

| Condition | `/` behavior |
| --------- | ------------ |
| Valid member session | Redirect `/me/registrations` |
| No session | Show club home or link to marketing `/tours` |

---

## Verification

| ID | Assert |
| -- | ------ |
| MEM-01 | Session cookie set after OTP verify (existing user) |
| MEM-02 | Session cookie set after register-complete (new user) |
| MEM-03 | `GET /me/registrations` 401 without session |
| MEM-04 | Member cannot read another user's registration — `GET /bookings?view=mine` scoped to `submittedByUserId` |
| MEM-05 | Logout clears cookie |

Specs: `apps/portal/test/portal-member-*.spec.ts` · `apps/api/test/portal-member-registrations.spec.ts` · **MEM-04** `apps/api/test/bookings-member-isolation.spec.ts` (`view=mine` never leaks another member's booking row)

